<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia inflation outlook positive-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia inflation outlook positive-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday March quarter GDP data showed there was a very positive inflation outlook.  </p>
<p>&quot;The accounts provide further evidence that we are looking at a very positive inflation outlook with the deflators around 1.5 percent to 2.0 percent, consistent with measures of underlying inflation of about 2.0 percent,&quot; Costello told a news conference after March quarter national accounts data.</p>
<p>The GDP-E (expenditure) deflator rose 0.3 percent in the March quarter and was up 1.6 percent on the March quarter a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
